el.train(saved_mode)\n\ndiagnosis_interpreter_prompt(raw_diagnosis):\n    embed measured metrics and their definitions\n    request evidence-linked findings, unsupported-probe notes, and uncertainty\n    distinguish in-sample sensitivity from validation generalization\n    prohibit inferred intent, ownership, dislikes, unavailable traits, or unmeasured gains\n\nbounded_falsification_experiment():\n    train only preregistered interventions that fit remaining GPU budget\n    run pinned validation unchanged at frozen checkpoints\n    compare predicted directions with paired intervention HR@10 changes\n    report per-category and macro results, simple comparator signals, and uncertainty\n    retain selection by pinned macro validation HR@10\n    record null/contradictory findings and stop unsupported probe expansion",
