      - Analysis: {"status":"NEEDS_IMPROVEMENT","core_findings":["Each category-prefixed diagnostic reports only unlabeled_route and incomplete four-route coverage; category routing is therefore unverified. Model-order agreement is unavailable.","Across 50 cases per supplied category, recent-minus-older removal worsens mean sampled rank by 1.32/2.52/0.36/1.60 positions (Movies/Industrial/Electronics/CDs). This suggests sensitivity to recent evidence under repacking, which also changes positions and context; uncertainty intervals and position-preserving results are not supplied."],"key_implications":["Last-item deletion changes the final query, so its effects cannot isolate the value of recent versus older history.","These fitted-model, in-sample interventions establish neither host validation HR@10 nor generalization, preference intent, or training stability; representation-health measurements are unavailable in the supplied excerpt."],"evidence":{"headline_metrics":{"four_route_coverage_complete_each_report":false,"recent_minus_older_sampled_mean_rank_delta":[1.32,2.52,0.36,1.6],"last_item_deletion_sampled_mean_rank_delta":[3.0,1.62,0.16,1.32],"local_shuffle_sampled_mean_rank_delta":[-0.0769,0.5161,0.8,0.24],"local_shuffle_case_counts":[26,31,20,25]},"brief_metric_read":{"array_order":"Movies_and_TV, Industrial_and_Scientific, Electronics, CDs_and_Vinyl.","rank_delta":"Positive means worse target rank on fixed diagnostic candidates; auxiliary sampling does not reproduce host evaluation.","local_shuffle":"Small aggregate signed rank changes with the final item preserved; cancellation and missing intervals limit interpretation of order sensitivity.","missing_controls":"Position-preserving results and bootstrap intervals are not visible; missing evidence does not establish stability."}}}
    
